{
  "about": [
    "The relative cycle grid a Flow item's Cycle Scope is picked on, written as data.",
    "",
    "Both evaluators replay it. `src-tauri/tests/operations/flow_cycles_conformance.rs` runs every case",
    "through `flows::rules::cycle_grid`; `src/utils/flow-cycles-conformance.test.ts` runs the same",
    "cases through `flow-cycle.ts`, the Flow editor's navigator. Neither side generates this file.",
    "",
    "The grid counts nominal subdivisions \u2014 three months to a season, four weeks to a month, seven",
    "days to a week, six parts to a day \u2014 since the window is unanchored while the template is",
    "edited. `subdivisions` names how many `child` units one `parent` holds (one for the same kind,",
    "none for a coarser child or a kind off the grid); `levels` the navigator's levels from the",
    "Flow's own period down to a target kind; `paths` the flat 1-based index a 1-based path names."
